{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "60ff3606-d132-8138-bec4-dd9dd28cc234",
  "created_at": "2026-01-21T10:36:06-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Zoning and Inspections",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Fatima Silva",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Anita Chaudhry",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T10:32:35-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Zoning and Inspections, this is Anita. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T10:32:39-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yes, good morning. Sure, of course. I'm calling about a fence. I want to put one up and I don't know if I need a permit or not."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T10:32:49-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, happy to help with that. Is this for a property here in Newport?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T10:32:54-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, absolutely. It's 417 Spring Street, in the Fifth Ward. I'm the homeowner."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T10:32:59-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Great, thank you. And what's the fence for, what are you trying to do?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T10:33:04-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, it's for the dog. She keeps slipping out of the yard, she's very quick, so I just want something closed in, you know. Sorry, hold on, I have the TV on. It's one of those baking shows and it's very distracting. Let me turn it down. Okay. Sorry."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T10:33:20-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem at all. So a fence around the yard. Do you know what material you're planning, and about how tall?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T10:33:27-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, yes. Pressure-treated wood. And as tall as they let me, really. Whatever is allowed. Is there a height where it stops needing a permit? Like under a certain height you don't need one?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T10:33:38-05:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Generally, a fence does need a permit here, and the allowed height depends on where it sits on the lot, front yard versus side and back. I don't want to hand you a number that's wrong for your property, so I'd have someone confirm the exact height for your lot. Is the fence going in the front, the back, or around the whole thing?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T10:33:58-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Of course, yes. Um, the back and the sides. Not the front. I think. Well, the side by the driveway, is that the front?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T10:34:06-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It depends. Where does the side fence start, back by the house corner or out near the street?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T10:34:13-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Absolutely, I see what you mean. It would start at the corner of the house, I think. Not out by the sidewalk."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T10:34:21-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, that helps. So you'd apply for the permit, and they'd want a simple sketch showing where the fence goes and how far it sits from your property line."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T10:34:31-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, sure. A sketch. Do I draw it myself? Or does somebody have to do it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T10:34:37-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You can usually draw it yourself, as long as it's clear. If you have a survey of your lot, that's useful to mark on."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T10:34:45-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, yes, absolutely, I think I have something like that in a folder. And how long does it take? To get approved?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T10:34:53-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "For a plain residential fence it's typically fairly quick, often within a couple of weeks, but it can vary with how busy we are and whether your sketch is complete. Don't buy the lumber until you have the approval in hand."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T10:35:07-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Of course, no, I won't. Wait, so, a couple of weeks, but not a promise?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T10:35:13-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, that's a typical range, not a guarantee. Would you like me to have someone from the office call you back about the height for your lot?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T10:35:22-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, please, that would be great. Sure. My number is 401-555-0155."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T10:35:26-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 401-555-0155, Fatima Silva, 417 Spring Street. I'll note it's a wood fence, back and side yard, for the dog."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T10:35:33-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, perfect. So just to be sure, I do need a permit, even for a low one?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T10:35:39-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "In general, yes, plan on needing one. The person who calls you can tell you if there's any exception for your situation."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T10:35:47-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Absolutely. I'm still a little mixed up about the front part, but they can explain that, right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T10:35:54-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, they'll go through it with you. Bring that survey if you find it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T10:35:59-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, of course. Thank you so much. Bye now."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T10:36:03-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome. Have a good day."
    }
  ],
